    "body": "Thanks, it seems that we should wait a bit with this until Feature Policy is properly upstreamed. At that point I would expect documents to have a field we can explicitly reference here and test that the field contains \"autoplay\" (is there no syntax for feature names?).\r\n\r\nThere's a few things that can be done meanwhile though:\r\n\r\n* Ensure there are corresponding web-platform-tests tests created and linked from this PR.\r\n* Ensure browser bugs are filed and linked from this PR.",
