    "updated_at": "2018-11-14T23:22:16Z",
    "body": "This seems to have been obsoleted by https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/3829; however that PR modified \"eligible for autoplay\", not \"allowed to play\". @rebeccahughes, @clelland, @mounirlamouri, should we close this, or is that mismatch worth straightening out?",
