    "body": "Hmm. I'm unclear what the current implementation status is for things like `.play()` and its ties to feature policy. E.g. if you set the autoplay-allowed feature policy, does that mean the page can call `play()` no matter what, in contemporary implementations? (Even without user activation?)",
