    "body": "I would be hesitant to outline the actual algorithm in the spec because its specific to a browser.\r\n\r\nFor reference the code in Blink is in [AutoplayPolicy](https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/media/autoplay_policy.cc).",
